*==============================================================================*
* TIMES.jl reference harness hook (not part of TIMES).
* Included by main_ext.mod for stage init_ext when 'TJLREF' is passed to
* initmty.mod, i.e. at the extensions' init_ext (maindrv.mod L55, v4.9.7):
* after init_ext.dsc and init_ext.vda, before ppmain. An M1.3 checkpoint:
* dumps every symbol declared so far, only in runs the harness starts with
* --TJL_CHECKPOINTS=1 (the pre-solve run).
*==============================================================================*
$IF SET TJL_CHECKPOINTS execute_unload 'tjl_init.gdx';
